# Wi-Fi Security

## Recommended settings
| Setting | Recommendation |
|---|---|
| Encryption | WPA3 if supported, otherwise WPA2 with AES |
| Wi-Fi password | Long passphrase, shared only with staff |
| WPS | Turn off |
| Network name (SSID) | Do not include the business name or personal details |
| Guest network | Separate network with its own password |
| Admin page | Protected with a strong password |

## Good habits
- Change the Wi-Fi password when someone leaves the team.
- Check the list of connected devices regularly and remove ones you do not recognise.
- Keep access point firmware updated.
